{# proof_gallery — a framed CREDIBILITY photo row (DNA §C4 social-proof). A row
   of full-COLOR human/deal photos (the ST-05 `proof` slots — real moments that
   say "these are our clients/results"), each a fixed-aspect background-image
   plate under a subtle 1-line frame. An OPTIONAL small uppercase label sits above
   the row (e.g. "Referenzen" / "Bekannt aus"). All under the c-proof-gallery
   namespace; the token-only look (frame, tile rhythm, full-color — NOT grayscale,
   unlike the logo wall) lives in styles/components.css.

   photos  list of resolved image URIs (the proof photos). When present, each
           becomes a framed tile in a wrapping row.
   label   OPTIONAL small uppercase content label above the row.

   GRACEFUL: an empty `photos` list renders NOTHING (no label, no frame) — so a
   client with no proof photos shows no empty band. Brand-agnostic: tokens ONLY,
   no hex / font / client literal. #}
{% macro proof_gallery(photos, label='') -%}
{% if photos %}
<div class="c-proof-gallery">
  {% if label %}<div class="c-proof-gallery__label">{{ label }}</div>{% endif %}
  <div class="c-proof-gallery__row">
    {% for src in photos %}
    <span class="c-proof-gallery__item" role="img" style="background-image:url('{{ src }}');"></span>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
{% endif %}
{%- endmacro %}
